\pard\f1 Execution Result\par Item | Value | Meaning\par --- | --- | ---\par return_value | None | \u31243?\u24207?\u26368?\u32456?\u-28716?\u22238?\u20540?\par \par Variables\par Name | Value\par --- | ---\par m | 0\par t1 | 0\par t2 | 0\par t3 | 0\par \par Execution Trace\par Step | Quad / Event | Meaning\par --- | --- | ---\par 1 | 1: (call, read, _, t1) | \u-29693?\u29992?\u20989?\u25968? read\u-244?\u32467?\u26524?\u20445?\u23384?\u21040? t1\par 2 | builtin read() -> 0 | \u27169?\u25311?\u20869?\u32622?\u-28781?\u20837?\u20989?\u25968? read\u-244?\u-24872?\u-29788?\u-29701?\u20837? 0\par 3 | 2: (=, t1, _, m) | m = t1\par 4 | 3: (para, m, _, _) | \u20934?\u22791?\u20989?\u25968?\u21442?\u25968? m\par 5 | 4: (call, f, _, t2) | \u-29693?\u29992?\u20989?\u25968? f\u-244?\u32467?\u26524?\u20445?\u23384?\u21040? t2\par 6 | call f(0) | \u-29693?\u29992?\u29992?\u25143?\u-32278?\u23450?\u20041?\u20989?\u25968?\par 7 | 9: fn (J==, n, 1, 11) | \u26465?\u20214?\u25104?\u31435?\u26102?\u-29197?\u-28820?\u21040?\u22235?\u20803?\u24335? 11\par 8 | 10: fn (J, _, _, 13) | \u26080?\u26465?\u20214?\u-29197?\u-28820?\u21040?\u22235?\u20803?\u24335? 13\par 9 | 13: fn (J==, n, 2, 15) | \u26465?\u20214?\u25104?\u31435?\u26102?\u-29197?\u-28820?\u21040?\u22235?\u20803?\u24335? 15\par 10 | 14: fn (J, _, _, 17) | \u26080?\u26465?\u20214?\u-29197?\u-28820?\u21040?\u22235?\u20803?\u24335? 17\par 11 | 17: fn (J==, n, 3, 19) | \u26465?\u20214?\u25104?\u31435?\u26102?\u-29197?\u-28820?\u21040?\u22235?\u20803?\u24335? 19\par 12 | 18: fn (J, _, _, 20) | \u26080?\u26465?\u20214?\u-29197?\u-28820?\u21040?\u22235?\u20803?\u24335? 20\par 13 | 20: fn (-, n, 1, t4) | t4 = n - 1\par 14 | 21: fn (para, t4, _, _) | \u20934?\u22791?\u20989?\u25968?\u21442?\u25968? t4\par 15 | 22: fn (call, f, _, t5) | \u-29693?\u29992?\u20989?\u25968? f\u-244?\u32467?\u26524?\u20445?\u23384?\u21040? t5\par 16 | 23: fn (=, t5, _, a) | a = t5\par 17 | 24: fn (-, n, 2, t6) | t6 = n - 2\par 18 | 25: fn (para, t6, _, _) | \